-     * Uses Adreno's GL_QCOM_shading_rate / GL_EXT_fragment_shading_rate
-     * to reduce GPU shader work on screen edges while keeping center at full rate.
-     * Levels: 1=conservative (2x1), 2=aggressive (2x2), 3=ultra (4x4 edges)
